  {
   "verse_number": 2,
   "source_text_master": [
    "rādhikābhāba[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]gambhīra[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA],    citta yebā mahādhīra,",
    "gaṇa[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]saṅga nā kaila jībane",
    "kemane se śyāmānanda,    rasasindhu[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]snānānanda,",
    "labhibe bujhaha ekamane 2"
   ],
   "translations": [
    {
     "language_code": "eng",
     "text": [
      "…and who in this life has not associated with the devotees of Śrīmatī Rādhikā—whose moods are deep and grave and whose heart is extremely sober—how will such a person ever experience the bliss of bathing in the ocean of the rasa of ecstatic love for Śrī Śyāmasundara? Please understand this most carefully."
     ]
    }
   ],
